    "fullContentHtml":  "\n\u003ch1 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-e52a0102 gb-headline-text\"\u003eIB ACIO Gr-II Executive Final Result 2026\u003c/h1\u003e\n\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-container gb-container-659bd175\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-container gb-container-a344b6f7\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-container gb-container-31d42cf5\"\u003e\n\n\u003cp class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-c57ae0af gb-headline-text\"\u003ePost Date: \u003ctime class=\"entry-date published\" datetime=\"2026-06-03T17:26:10+05:30\"\u003eJune 3, 2026\u003c/time\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\n\u003cspan class=\"custom-post-time\"\u003e5:26 pm\u003c/span\u003e\n\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\n\u003cp class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-550ae316 short_Details gb-headline-text\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: justify;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://www.mha.gov.in/notifications/vacancies\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eIntelligence Bureau (IB), Ministry of Home Affairs\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/a\u003e, has released the\u003cstrong\u003e Final Result\u003c/strong\u003e\u0026nbsp;on its\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong\u003eofficial website\u003c/strong\u003e for the \u003cstrong\u003eAssistant Central Intelligence Officer Grade II / Executive Post.\u003c/strong\u003e The tier-II exam was held on \u003cstrong\u003e11 January 2026,\u003c/strong\u003e\u0026nbsp;and the last date to submit the application form was\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong data-start=\"230\" data-end=\"250\"\u003e10 August 2025\u003c/strong\u003e. Candidates can check their \u003cb\u003eFinal Result\u003c/b\u003e\u0026nbsp;using their\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong data-start=\"302\" data-end=\"362\"\u003eEnrollment Number, Registration Number, or Date of Birth\u003c/strong\u003e\u0026nbsp;by logging into the portal. The direct link is provided below.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-container gb-container-9849916c\"\u003e\n\n\u003cp\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cdiv style=\"text-align:center;\"\u003e\n\u003ca href=\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.vinod.sarkarinaukri\u0026amp;hl=en_IN\" class=\"apply-button\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"\u003e\n        Download SarkariResult App Now\n    \u003c/a\u003e\n    \u003c/div\u003e\n    \n\u003cdiv class=\"social-buttons\"\u003e\u003c!-- WhatsApp Button --\u003e \u003ca class=\"social-button whatsapp\" href=\"https://whatsapp.com/channel/0029VaAbQf01NCrYADMLt00L\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"\u003e WhatsApp \u003c/a\u003e \u003c!-- Telegram Button --\u003e \u003ca class=\"social-button telegram\" href=\"https://t.me/SarkariExam_info\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"\u003e Telegram \u003c/a\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n\n\n\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-container gb-container-f58e6ca1\"\u003e\n\n\u003ch2 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-2ca5a791 gb-headline-text\"\u003eIB ACIO Gr-II Executive Final Result 2026 – Out\u003c/h2\u003e\n\n\n\u003ch3 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-7d5f86e8 gb-headline-text\"\u003eIB ACIO Grade-II / Executive Examination 2025 : Short Details\u003c/h3\u003e\n\n\u003cp class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-79adf169 gb-headline-text\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://sarkariresult.com.cm/ib-acio-gr-ii-executive-2025/\"\u003eSarkariResult.com.cm\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-grid-wrapper gb-grid-wrapper-303102a8\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-grid-column gb-grid-column-d96c68be\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"gb-container gb-container-d96c68be\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-container gb-container-16a90584\"\u003e\n\n\u003ch4 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-22b2e02b gb-headline-text\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eImportant Dates\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h4\u003e\n\n\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-3b2f0e17 gb-headline-text\"\u003e\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eOnline Apply Start Date: \u003cstrong\u003e19 July 2025\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eOnline Apply Last Date : \u003cstrong\u003e10 August 2025\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003ePay Exam Fee Last Date : \u003cstrong\u003e10 August 2025\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eExam Date :\u003cstrong\u003e 16, 17 \u0026amp; 18 September 2025\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eAdmit Card Date : \u003cstrong\u003e13 September 2025\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eAnswer Key :\u003cstrong\u003e 22 September 2025\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eResult : \u003cstrong\u003e21 November 2025\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eTier-II Exam Date :\u003cstrong\u003e 11 January 2026\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eTier-II Exam City Details : \u003cspan style=\"color: #000000;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e01 January 2026\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eResult Declared Date : \u003cstrong\u003e05 March 2026\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eFinal Result : \u003cspan style=\"color: #ff0000;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e03 June 2026 Available Now\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-grid-column gb-grid-column-fcbb81ff\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"gb-container gb-container-fcbb81ff\"\u003e\n\n\u003ch4 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-4ddaf9ee gb-headline-text\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eApplication Fee\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h4\u003e\n\n\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-989f3ffd gb-headline-text\"\u003e\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eFor General, OBC, EWS : \u003cstrong\u003eRs 650/-\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eFor SC, ST : \u003cstrong\u003eRs 550/-\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eFor All Females : \u003cstrong\u003eRs 550/-\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003ePay the Examination Fee Through \u003cstrong\u003eIB ACIO Grade-II / Executive\u003c/strong\u003e\u0026nbsp;Kiosk OR Debit Card, Credit Card, Net Banking.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-container gb-container-6b6fbcac\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-grid-wrapper gb-grid-wrapper-8aa46b64\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-grid-column gb-grid-column-0f18d865\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"gb-container gb-container-0f18d865\"\u003e\n\u003ch5 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-0b3ada47 gb-headline-text\"\u003eIB ACIO Grade-II / Executive Notification 2025 : Age Limits As On 10 August 2025\u003c/h5\u003e\n\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-28dede61 gb-headline-text\"\u003e\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eMinimum Age : \u003cstrong\u003e18 Years\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eMaximum Age : \u003cstrong\u003e27 Years\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eIB ACIO\u003c/strong\u003e provides age relaxation for the\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong\u003eGrade-II / Executive\u0026nbsp;Recruitment \u003c/strong\u003eposition as per their regulations.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-grid-column gb-grid-column-860b2712\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"gb-container gb-container-860b2712\"\u003e\n\n\u003ch5 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-f2184b83 gb-headline-text\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eTotal Post\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h5\u003e\n\n\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-4259c0c2 gb-headline-text\"\u003e3717 Posts\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\n\n\n\u003c!-- SarkariResult --\u003e\n\n\n\u003cdiv style=\"text-align:center;\"\u003e\n\u003ca href=\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.vinod.sarkarinaukri\u0026amp;hl=en_IN\" class=\"apply-button\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"\u003e\n        Download SarkariResult App Now\n    \u003c/a\u003e\n    \u003c/div\u003e\n    \n\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\n\n\n\u003c!-- SarkariResult --\u003e\n\n\n\n\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-container gb-container-ec1f6e4c\"\u003e\n\u003ch6 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-c7683bda gb-headline-text\"\u003eIB ACIO Grade-II / Executive Recruitment 2025 : Vacancy Details\u003c/h6\u003e\n\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-60ccea19 gb-headline-text\"\u003e\u003ctable style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\"\u003e\n\u003ctbody\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 22.2111%; text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePost Name\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 16.8002%; text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eTotal Post\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 60.9886%; text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eEligibility\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 22.2111%; text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eIB ACIO Grade-II / Executive\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 16.8002%; text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e3717\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 60.9886%;\"\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eBachelor’s degree in \u003cstrong\u003eany stream\u003c/strong\u003e from a recognized university.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003c/tbody\u003e\n\u003c/table\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ctable style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\"\u003e\n\u003ctbody\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 100%; text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"background-color: #000080; color: #ffffff;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u0026nbsp;How To Check \u0026amp; Download IB ACIO Grade-II / Executive Final Result 2026\u0026nbsp;\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 100%;\"\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"119\" data-end=\"175\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"121\" data-end=\"175\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eOpen your internet browser on your phone or computer\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"176\" data-end=\"242\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"178\" data-end=\"242\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eVisit the \u003cstrong data-start=\"188\" data-end=\"240\"\u003eofficial website of the Intelligence Bureau (IB)\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"243\" data-end=\"338\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"245\" data-end=\"338\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eOn the homepage, go to the \u003cstrong data-start=\"272\" data-end=\"328\"\u003eRecruitment / Latest Updates / Candidate Information\u003c/strong\u003e section\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"339\" data-end=\"441\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"341\" data-end=\"441\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eLook for the notification that mentions \u003cstrong data-start=\"381\" data-end=\"439\"\u003eACIO Grade-II/Executive Final Result 2026\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"442\" data-end=\"485\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"444\" data-end=\"485\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eClick on the \u003cstrong data-start=\"457\" data-end=\"478\"\u003eResult\u003c/strong\u003e link\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"486\" data-end=\"573\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"488\" data-end=\"573\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eThe exam city information will open in \u003cstrong data-start=\"527\" data-end=\"541\"\u003ePDF format\u003c/strong\u003e (or a page with your details)\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"574\" data-end=\"668\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"576\" data-end=\"668\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eIf it opens as a PDF, use the \u003cstrong data-start=\"606\" data-end=\"624\"\u003esearch feature\u003c/strong\u003e to find your \u003cstrong data-start=\"638\" data-end=\"666\"\u003eregistration/roll number\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"669\" data-end=\"737\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"671\" data-end=\"737\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eDownload or save the \u003cstrong data-start=\"692\" data-end=\"720\"\u003ePDF or result page\u003c/strong\u003e to your device\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"738\" data-end=\"792\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"740\" data-end=\"792\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eTake a \u003cstrong data-start=\"747\" data-end=\"759\"\u003eprintout\u003c/strong\u003e if needed for future reference\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003c/tbody\u003e\n\u003c/table\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ctable style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\"\u003e\n\u003ctbody\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 100%; text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"background-color: #000080; color: #ffffff; font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u0026nbsp;IB ACIO Grade-II / Executive Recruitment 2025 : Mode Of Selection\u0026nbsp;\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 100%;\"\u003e\n\u003cul class=\"wp-block-list\"\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eTier-I Written Exam\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eTier-II Written Exam\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eInterview (100 Marks)\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eDocument Verification\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eMedical Examination\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003c/tbody\u003e\n\u003c/table\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\n\n\u003ch6 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-cbf2939c gb-headline-text\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u00