ng\u003e\u003c/h5\u003e\n\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center; background-color: #fff091;\"\u003e\n\u003ch5\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://g03.tcsion.com//per/g03/pub/726/EForms/image/ImageDocUpload/71161/1/2101671558.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: #0000ff;\"\u003e\u003cb\u003eClick Here\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/h5\u003e\n\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center; background-color: #fff091;\"\u003e\n\u003ch5\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eIB ACIO Official Website\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h5\u003e\n\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center; background-color: #fff091;\"\u003e\n\u003ch5\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://www.mha.gov.in/notifications/vacancies\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: #0000ff;\"\u003e\u003cb\u003eClick Here\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/h5\u003e\n\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003c/tbody\u003e\n\u003c/table\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ctable style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\"\u003e\n\u003ctbody\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 100%; text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: #ffffff; background-color: #000080; font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u0026nbsp;IB ACIO Gr-II Executive Final Result 2026 : Important Question\u0026nbsp;\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 100%;\"\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eQuestion:\u003c/strong\u003e Which authority releases the IB ACIO Final Result?\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAnswer:\u003c/strong\u003e The final result are released by the \u003cstrong data-start=\"219\" data-end=\"247\"\u003eIntelligence Bureau (IB)\u003c/strong\u003e.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 100%;\"\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eQuestion:\u003c/strong\u003e For which post are the final result released?\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAnswer:\u003c/strong\u003e They are released for the \u003cstrong data-start=\"345\" data-end=\"374\"\u003eACIO Grade-II / Executive\u003c/strong\u003e post.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 100%;\"\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eQuestion:\u003c/strong\u003e What are exam city details?\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAnswer:\u003c/strong\u003e Exam city details inform candidates about the \u003cstrong data-start=\"466\" data-end=\"524\"\u003ecity where their Tier-II examination centre is located\u003c/strong\u003e.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 100%;\"\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eQuestion:\u003c/strong\u003e Has the IB ACIO Gr-II Executive Tier-II exam city details 2025 been released?\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAnswer:\u003c/strong\u003e Yes, the exam city details have been officially released by IB.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 100%;\"\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eQuestion:\u003c/strong\u003e What is the official website of \u003cstrong\u003eIB\u003c/strong\u003e?\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAnswer:\u003c/strong\u003e The official website of Rajasthan \u003cstrong\u003eIB\u003c/strong\u003e is \u003cstrong\u003ehttps://rsmssb.rajasthan.gov.in/.\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003c/tbody\u003e\n\u003c/table\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone size-large wp-image-28109\" src=\"http://sarkariresult.com.cm/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/IB-ACIO-Grade-II-Executive-Tier-II-Exam-City-Details-2025-1024x576.jpg\" alt=\"IB ACIO Gr-II Executive Tier-II Exam City Details 2025\" width=\"1024\" height=\"576\" srcset=\"https://sarkariresult.com.cm/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/IB-ACIO-Grade-II-Executive-Tier-II-Exam-City-Details-2025-1024x576.jpg 1024w, https://sarkariresult.com.cm/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/IB-ACIO-Grade-II-Executive-Tier-II-Exam-City-Details-2025-300x169.jpg 300w, https://sarkariresult.com.cm/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/IB-ACIO-Grade-II-Executive-Tier-II-Exam-City-Details-2025-768x432.jpg 768w, https://sarkariresult.com.cm/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/IB-ACIO-Grade-II-Executive-Tier-II-Exam-City-Details-2025.jpg 1200w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-container gb-container-ce6e23c9\"\u003e\n\n\u003cp class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-a1cd0fe1\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"gb-headline-text\"\u003eSarkari Result.Com.Cm\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\n\n\n\n\u003c!-- SarkariResult --\u003e\n\n\n\n\n\u003ctable style=\"width:100%; border-collapse: collapse;\"\u003e\u003ctbody\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003ctd style=\"width:50%; padding: 10px; vertical-align: top; border: 1px solid #ddd;\"\u003e\u003ch3\u003